---
import HeroSection from "./HeroSection.astro"
import RelocationNotice from "./RelocationNotice.astro"
import Quote from "./Quote.astro"
import QuoteWithLine from "./QuoteWithLine.astro"
import ServicesSection from "./ServicesSection.astro"
import InsuranceCompanies from "./InsuranceCompanies.astro"
import ContactSection from './ContactSection.astro'
import BlobBackground from "../BlobBackground.astro"
---
<main>
    <HeroSection/>
    <div id="intro">
        <BlobBackground blobs={[
            { tone: "salmon", size: 600, top: "2%", left: "-200px" },
            { tone: "teal", size: 680, top: "8%", right: "-240px", duration: 24, reverse: true },
            { tone: "mint", size: 560, top: "48%", left: "28%", duration: 26 },
            { tone: "salmon", size: 520, bottom: "6%", right: "-120px", duration: 22, reverse: true },
        ]}/>

        <div class="intro-inner">
            <RelocationNotice/>
            <div class="reveal"><Quote>Naše centrum Vám nabízí komplexní ambulantní služby v oboru fyzioterapie a léčebné rehabilitace, pro všechny věkové kategorie.</Quote></div>
            <div class="reveal"><InsuranceCompanies/></div>
            <div class="reveal"><QuoteWithLine>Jsme ambulantní nestátní zdravotnické zařízení zaměřené na diagnostiku, terapii a prevenci všech problémů pohybového aparátu, tedy bolestí zad, kloubů a svalů, funkčních i degenerativních onemocnění, poúrazových a pooperačních stavů i problémů z oblasti neurologie, gynekologie, urologie či jiných internterních oborů.</QuoteWithLine></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <ServicesSection/>
    <ContactSection/>
</main>
<style>
    /* Region between hero and services: starts and ends on white so it melts into both */
    #intro {
        position: relative;
        overflow: clip;
        padding: 24px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 72px; /* room for the last card's shadow inside the clip */
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, white 0%, var(--background-lighter-blue) 14%, var(--background-lighter-blue) 86%, white 100%);
    }
    .intro-inner {
        position: relative;
        max-width: 1240px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: clamp(72px, 8vw, 120px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
        #intro {
            padding: 16px 16px 64px;
        }
    }

    @keyframes reveal {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(28px);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    }
    /* Progressive enhancement: blocks below the notice rise in as they scroll into view */
    @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
            .reveal {
                animation: reveal linear both;
                animation-timeline: view();
                animation-range: entry 0% entry 35%;
            }
        }
    }
</style>
